OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as man told to apologise
OL,4,Aafter 'child assaulted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has said she is "disgusted"
OL,7,Fafter a man who allegedly strangled and
OL,8,Ftouched the breast of her 12-year-old
OL,9,Fdaughter was reportedly told by police
OL,10,Fto write an apology letter.
OL,12,FThe Stroud woman, who wished not to be
OL,13,Fnamed, said her daughter's best friend
OL,14,Fcalled her on 9 October "screaming"
OL,15,Fthat her daughter was being attacked.
OL,17,FShe said that after reporting the
OL,18,Fincident to police, the man was asked
OL,19,Fto write a letter of apology, which
OL,20,Fleft her "disgusted".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
