OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as man told to apologise
OL,4,Aafter 'child assaulted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire Police said the
OL,7,Finvestigating officer discussed the
OL,8,Fpossibility of a community resolution
OL,9,Fwith the victim's parents and that the
OL,10,Ffamily had made clear they did not
OL,11,Fsupport this outcome.
